      <version name="1.1.1" author="kallums" time="2026-10-15T12:00:00Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[Wording in the window follows Apple's writing guidelines: buttons read Use Selected Items, Insert on New Track, Put Back as Suggested and More Ideas, and messages say what to do next. Chord names now follow ScaleView Pro's latest reader, which names a chord the way Starting Blocks builds it where it can.]]></changelog>
