      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[{\pard Midi Suggester\par
Select a MIDI item - an imported .mid file is one - and run the script. For a melody it suggests chord progressions; for chords it suggests melodies. Audition a suggestion against the original, then insert it on a new track lined up bar for bar.\par
Needs ReaImGui, from the ReaTeam Extensions repository.\par}]]></description>
